    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40b92aecf5c5918c93204942",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛时，自己落败的未来闪过脑中，\n直到现在仍无法抹去那样的印象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2edb917d448964126ed1511d805b6efd37d6fd9d7b80fc1699e419cd99756df7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
