    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef09fa461ae398d71d89d153",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光在“菊花赏”落败了。\n但她盼望获胜、竭尽全力的表情中\n显露出心服口服的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a37ad24e64e587fc56a51e2b44b1d446fc64e4ecfad11c0edddcf0ffe22af2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
