    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d70954392e2127424a1ab95b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下次竞赛是“天皇赏（春）”，\n并已确定会跟成田大进\n在那时再次对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d9604e7b03c2681b59e0934c3a2d7a9698d2f0ff233280677d94e5329898950",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1023/storytimeline_501023426.json",
      "json_path": [
