      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光在“天皇赏（春）”中获胜。\n但世人至今仍只将她视为\n“成田白仁的姐姐”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "343686e04afb1d8c4822035ac2ff866b7fb6401de5b467e34e3a31e0356f0850",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
