      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是没有变更举办场所，\n“方程式”的准确度会比现在更高，\n应当能展现出更强大的实力──",
      "source_fingerprint": "668af1cb3e30401e9e2612696760a273d1592a8839bc5f6851edbc1ba2ba47c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
